{"title":"Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf you own a pod vaping system, buying replacement pods periodically is going to be a major aspect of using and maintaining your device. When your pod system no longer produces the pure and enjoyable flavour that it did when the pod was new, that’s when you know it’s time to replace the pod.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn this page, you’ll find replacement pods for all of the most popular \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"Vape pod\"\u003evape pod \u003c\/a\u003esystems on the market from makers like Uwell (Caliburn), SMOK, Aspire, Innokin and more.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Replacement Pods – 4 Pcs","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn KOKO Replacement Pods are designed for the Uwell Caliburn koko pod system Featuring a 2ml nic salt e-liquid capacity and an atomizer resistance of 1.2 ohm. Each KOKO re-fillable pod features a magnetic connection and fits smoothly into the housing. The housing that holds the pod in place has a side view window which allows users to casually check their juice level without removing the pod itself.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNote: The original Caliburn Replacement Pods are compatible with the KOKO device.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn KOKO Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRe-Fillable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.5mm Fill Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 ohm Atomizer Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Fill Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold Plated Contacts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eOne Pack of Four (4) 1.2 ohm Caliburn Pod.","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531606859831,"sku":"U Cali Koko Replace Pods - 4 pcs","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Uwell-Caliburn-Koko-Replacement-Pods.jpg?v=1741702523"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2s-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn A2S Pods (4-Pack), featuring a 2mL capacity, side fill system, and an integrated 1.2ohm meshed coil for maximum flavor. Cross-compatible with the original Caliburn A2 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2s Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2S Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-15w-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2 Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2 Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN A2S Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm A2S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with 0.9ohm A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of four (4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531626881079,"sku":"U Cali A2S Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2_side_refilling_pod_-_accessories_-_box-min.png?v=1741703112"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-neat-2-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Yearn Neat 2 Replacement Pods","description":"Check out the Uwell YEARN NEAT 2 Replacement Pods, featuring a 2mL capacity, 0.9ohm integrated UN2 Meshed H Coil, and Pro-FOCS flavor technology.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell YEARN NEAT 2 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Pro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003cbr\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629043767,"sku":"U Yearn Neat 2 Replace Pods","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_yearn_neat_2_-_refillable_pods_-_fecral_0.9_ohm.png?v=1741703391"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges","title":"Uwell Yearn Replacement Pod Cartridges","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe asked Uwell to release refillable pod cartridges for the Uwell Yearn pod device because we love it so much and now they're here - a refillable (empty) alternative to the pre-filled pods for the Yearn.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yearn has been our best selling closed pod device and now it's open to use with all your favourite liquids! Amazing, right?!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePacket of 4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.5 ml Capacity with side fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.4 Ohm Resistance Cotton Vertical Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWe strongly suggest the use of 50\/50 PG\/VG salt based e-liquids for this device to ensure your pods don't burn out prematurely.\u003c\/strong\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629076535,"sku":"U Yearn Replace Pod Cartridges","price":1250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges-4-pack.jpg?v=1741703396"},{"product_id":"uwell-sculptor-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Sculptor Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Sculptor Pods (2-Pack), featuring a 1.6mL capacity, side fill system, and \u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.2ohm\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eintegrated coil for delicious flavor and vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-sculptor-11w-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Sculptor Pod System\"\u003eUwell Sculptor 11W Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Sculptor Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 1.6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill: Side Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil: Integrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531764834359,"sku":"U Sculptor Replace Pods","price":1149.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_sculptor_refillable_pod_accessories_box.png?v=1741709759"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso XROS Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso XROS Pods (4-PACK), featuring 2mL \u0026amp;amp; 3mL refillable pods, a hidden top-fill system, and utilizes a mesh coil heating structure. Constructed with a transparent juice viewing window, the XROS replacement pods allow for the user to check juice levels without removing the pod. Equipped with an integrated mesh coil, the XROS pods consist of a 0.8ohm and 1.2ohm mesh coil pod, facilitating a hidden top fill system revealed by taking off the mouthpiece. At the base is a magnetic pod connection, allowing quick and easy coil replacements while securing the pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-nano-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso xros nano pod system\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Nano Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-16w-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso xros 16w pod system\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS Replacement Pods Features\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL \u0026amp;amp; 3mL Pod Capacity Options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Hidden By Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransparent Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso XROS Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm XROS Mesh Pods (3mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.7ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm XROS Mesh Pods (3mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2) \/ four (4).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 0.6ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766439991,"sku":"69d25d432875b","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 1.0ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766472759,"sku":"69d25d44e721a","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 1.2ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766505527,"sku":"69d25d458f5cb","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 0.7ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766538295,"sku":"69d25d43bc0bf","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 0.8ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766571063,"sku":"69d25d445ac46","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_xros_replacement_pods_-_boxes.jpg?v=1741709825"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-zero-s-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Zero S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover Vaporesso Zero S Pods \u003cstrong\u003e(2-Pack)\u003c\/strong\u003e, featuring a 2mL capacity, integrated 1.2ohm coil, and top filled behind the removeable mouthpiece. Cross-compatible with the original ZERO and ZERO 2.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-top-filling-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero 2 Top Filling Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Zero Top Filling Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero 2 Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Zero 2 Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Zero Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"1.0ohm Mesh Zero S Pod","offer_id":41531767881783,"sku":"69d25d45cead1","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"1.2ohm Mesh Zero S Pod","offer_id":41531767914551,"sku":"69d25d466ad40","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_zero_s_mesh_pod_-_accessories_-_box.png?v=1741709886"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-zero-2-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Zero 2 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso ZERO 2 Replacement Pods, featuring a 3mL capacity, bottom press-to-fill system, and comes in a 1.0ohm Mesh or 1.3ohm CCELL Pod.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso ZERO 2 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom Press-To-Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm Mesh Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.3ohm CCELL Coil Pod ( better for regular smokers )\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Mesh Version Pods","offer_id":41531768078391,"sku":"69d25d4979f28","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ccell Version Pods","offer_id":41531768111159,"sku":"69d25d48db3e4","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_zero_2_pods_-_accessories_-_all_types.png?v=1741709899"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-cartridge","title":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Vape Pod Cartridge","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Vaporesso Renova ZERO Vape Replacement Pods are specially designed for the ZERO Ultra Portable System, featuring a PTCG-constructed shell with 2mL juice capability alongside CCELL Coil with ceramic technology. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe utilization of ceramic heating elements delivers tremendous aroma of flavors, with reduction in spit-back and dry hit for longer longevity. \u003cem\u003eComes in pack of 2.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-userformat='{\"2\":4480,\"10\":2,\"11\":4,\"15\":\"arial,sans,sans-serif\"}' data-sheets-value='{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"Vaporesso Nexus Replacement Coil Features:\\n1.0ohm NX CCELL Coil - rated for 7-12W\\n1.0ohm NX Coil - rated for 7-12W (Traditional Cotton)\\nOrganic Cotton\\nStainless Steel Structure\"}'\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso ZERO Replacement Pod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e2 pcs in a box\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1.3ohm CCELL Coil - rated for 9\/10.5\/12.5W\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1.0ohm MESH Coil - rated for 9\/11\/13W\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePCTG Construction\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePush-to-Fill Design (PTF)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOrganic Cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProprietary Connection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Mesh Version Pods","offer_id":41531768438839,"sku":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Vape Pod Cartridge Mesh","price":1040.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ccell Version Pods","offer_id":41531768471607,"sku":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Vape Pod Cartridge Ccell","price":1040.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_renova_zero_replacement_pod_cartridges.jpg?v=1741709923"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-2-replacement-pods","title":"SMOK NOVO 2 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe SMOK NOVO 2 Replacement Pods are a trio of 2mL plastic pod cartridges designed for the SMOK Novo 2, the successor of the original Novo, offering a 1.0ohm Mesh and 1.4ohm MTL options that will extract the best flavor from the loaded eJuice. Featuring a side fill system stoppered by a silicone stopper, the NOVO 2 Replacement Pods come in a pack of three to provide a few flavor options or as replacement pods to change out a spent pod. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK Novo Pod, Features :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes with 2ml capacity.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 pieces each pack.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports easy side filling system.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531769946167,"sku":"69d25d4be7566","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-novo-2-replacement-pods.jpg?v=1741709995"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-replacement-pod-2ml","title":"SMOK Novo Replacement Pod 2ML","description":"The SMOK Novo Pod is designed for Novo Kit. It comes with 2ml capacity. 3 pieces each pack. It supports easy side filling system. Just get it as a spare part.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK Novo Pod, Features :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes with 2ml capacity.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 pieces each pack.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports easy side filling system.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531770339383,"sku":"SMOK Novo Replacement Pod 2ML","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/SMOK_Novo_Pods.jpg?v=1741710007"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-2x-replacement-pods","title":"Smok Novo 2X Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Smok Novo 2X pods are compatible with the \u003ca title=\"smok novo 2x pod kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-2x-20w-pod-system\"\u003eNovo 2X pod kit\u003c\/a\u003e and can hold up to 2ml of e-liquid. These pods have been designed to produce a small amount of vapour, which closely resembles the feeling of a cigarette. The Novo 2X refillable pods feature a built-in coil, which means when you finish one, you can just replace it with a new one.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Coil Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePush Fit Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9 Ohm Coil Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can easily refill the Smok Novo 2X just remove the mouthpiece to reveal the e-liquid port and fill it with your favourite e-liquid. This 0.9 Ohm pod uses a built-in mesh coil, which means that e-liquid is more effectively vaporised to improve flavour production. These pods are ideal for creating an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale and are best paired with e-liquids that are mixed with 50% PG or are PG heavy.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 x Smok Novo 2X replacement pods\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.9ohm Meshed","offer_id":41531771093047,"sku":"30","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8ohm Meshed","offer_id":41531771125815,"sku":"69d25d4ec2b53","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-novo-2x-pods-min.jpg?v=1741710035"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-4-empty-pods","title":"Smok Novo 4 Empty Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe SMOK NOVO 4 Replacement Pods are a set of pods crafted for the SMOK NOVO 4 Pod System, implementing a bottom press-fit coil installation method and features a large mouthpiece for drip tip style inhalation to fully enjoy the vaping experience provided by the NOVO 4 Pod System.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQUICK LINKS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca title=\"Smok Novo 4 Kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-4-25w-pod-kit\"\u003eSMOK Novo 4 Kit | 25w\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFEATURES:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK NOVO 4 Replacement Pod Cartridges\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System – Silicone Stoppered\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProprietary Magnetized Gold-Plated Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eINCLUDES: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 SMOK NOVO 4 Replacement Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531771158583,"sku":"69d25d4ec2485","price":1700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-novo-4-empty-pod-min.jpg?v=1741710039"},{"product_id":"uwell-popreel-p1-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Popreel P1 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Popreel P1 Pods (4-Pack), featuring delimited measuring lines, 2mL capacity, and integrates a 1.2ohm coil to deliver delicious vapor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-popreel-n1-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Popreel P1 13W Pod System\"\u003eUwell Popreel P1 13W Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Popreel P1 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2mL Refillable Pod\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGraded Measuring Lines\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531772272695,"sku":"U Popreel P1 Replace Pods","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_popreel_p1_pod_cartridge_-_accessories_-_box.png?v=1741710177"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn G Replacement Pods","description":"Check out the Uwell Caliburn G Replacement Pods, a leakproof 2mL capacity refillable pod, delivering delicious flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eUwell CALIBURN G Replacement Pods Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Fill Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652492501047,"sku":"U Cali G Replace Pods","price":1050.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g_pods_-_packaging.png?v=1746632966"},{"product_id":"caliburn-g3-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn G3 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn G3 refillable pods are designed for use with the Uwell Caliburn G3 vape kit. They can hold up to 2ml of e-liquid and you can pair them with any flavour or nicotine strength you like, so you can try different options and see what suits you best. The pods contain a built-in coil and are designed for MTL (Mouth To Lung) and RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2ml Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Filling\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL Vaping\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible With 50\/50 And High PG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Caliburn G3 pods feature an easy top-filling design, so you can refill them without even having to remove them from your device. To swap between an RDTL and MTL inhale, you can just switch between the 0.6 Ohm, 0.9 Ohm and 1.2 Ohm pods. When the built-in coil has burnt out, all you have to do is replace the entire pod, so no more fiddly coil changes. When it comes to choosing an e-liquid, we suggest pairing these pods with a 50% VG vape juice or higher PG option.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 x Uwell Caliburn G3 2ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.6 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492533815,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 0.6 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.9 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492566583,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 0.9 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.2 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492599351,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 1.2 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-g3-replacement-pods-min.jpg?v=1746632970"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-x-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn X Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn X Replacement Pods, featuring a 3mL pod capacity, top fill system, and is compatible with the Uwell Caliburn G\/G2 Coil Series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-x-20w-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn X Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn X Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAI