roduct_id":"smok-solus-replacement-pod","title":"Smok Solus Replacement Pod","description":"\u003cp\u003eSmok Solus Replacement Pod offers 2.5ml vape juice capacity, uses nic salt ejuices for MTL and RDL vaping. Made from PCTG, draw-activated, compatible with Smok Solus 2 Kit. Smok Solus 2 features a magnetic connection, moreover, you can refill from the side slot. It will be highly effective for quitting smoking and compatible with e-liquids that contain nicotine salts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures and Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCapacity: 2ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.8-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL and RDL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFit For SMOK SOLUS 2 and SMOK Solus GBox Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePerfect For Nic Salt E-juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 3pcs\/pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWHAT'S IN THE BOX:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThree (3) SMOK Solus 2 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-pods\" title=\"replacement pods\"\u003eReplacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775198601271,"sku":"S Solus Replace Pod","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-solus-replacement-pod-meshed-min.jpg?v=1752510898"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-gtx-series-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso GTX Series Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn one simple GTX Pod you get all these features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecure magnetic connection - don’t worry about the GTX Pod popping off accidentally.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBig clouds and delicious flavour from your e-liquid with Vaporesso GTX Coils.\u003cbr\u003eQuick fire.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop fill - simple quarter turn of top cap through silicone-covered port hole.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS leak-resistant technology in the pod which stands for: seal comprehensively with the o-rings that keep the air pressure in for a tighter draw store safely with extra seal that may prevent leaking while not in use saturate properly via the large coil openings to the cotton to avoid burning the coil or getting a dry hit (aka helps prime coil and keep the cotton wet while vaping).\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick coil change - simply pull the old coil out and plug in the new one\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable airflow - tighten or loosen your air intake. Perfect for direct-lung (DL) vaping (where you inhale vapour directly to the lungs from the drip tip)!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso GTX Pod 26 5 ml (TPD)\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso GTX Pod 22 3.5 ml (TPD)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe GTX 22 pod is 39.5 mm in height and 22.5 mm in diameter.\u003cbr\u003eThe GTX 26 pod is 40.5 mm in height and 26 mm in diameter.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGTX Pod 22 is designed for use in the Vaporesso GTX 40 Pod kit.\u003cbr\u003eGTX Pod 26 is designed for use in the Vaporesso GTX 80 Pod kit and Target 80 kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX replacement pods are recommended for use with both High VG 70+ (DTL), 50\/50 Freebase (MTL) and Nic Salt (MTL) E-Liquids.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"GTX 22 3.5ML","offer_id":41775207448631,"sku":"V GTX Series Replace Pods GTX 22 3.5 ml","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"GTX 26 5ML","offer_id":41775207481399,"sku":"V GTX Series Replace Pods GTX 26 5 ml","price":1950.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-pod-min.jpg?v=1752511690"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-q-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Luxe Q Replacement Pods -4 pack","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Vaporesso LUXE Q Replacement Pods, featuring a 2mL capacity, integrated 0.8ohm or 1.2ohm coils, and offers a leak-free top fill system.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS Leak-Resistant Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.8ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"0.8ohm LUXE Q Mesh Pod","offer_id":41775207809079,"sku":"V Luxe Q Replace Pods -4 pack - 0.8 ohm","price":1985.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"1.2ohm LUXE Q Mesh Pod","offer_id":41775207841847,"sku":"V Luxe Q Replace Pods -4 pack - 1.2 ohm","price":1985.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_q_replacement_pods_boxes.png?v=1752511743"},{"product_id":"voopoo-drag-nano-replacement-pods","title":"VooPoo S1 Drag Nano Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe VOOPOO POD-S1 Replacement Pods are a set of food-grade 1.0mL plastic pods, top filled, with an integrated coil resistance of 1.8ohms to vaporize complex nicotine salt juices. Designed specifically for the Voopoo Drag Nano Vape and VOOPOO ALPHA ZIP Pod Kit.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVOOPOO DRAG Nano Replacement Pod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.8ohm POD-S1 Cartridge - 1.0mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.5ohm DRAG NANO P1 Cartridge - 1.6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Coil Resistance: 1.8ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFood-Grade Plastic Pod Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Plug\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Voopoo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775207907383,"sku":"VooPoo S1 Drag Nano Replacement Pods","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/voopoo_drag_nano_pod-s1_replacement_pods.jpg?v=1752511750"},{"product_id":"caliburn-a3s-pods","title":"Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience enhanced vaping convenience with the Uwell Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods. Each pod boasts a 2mL refillable capacity, allowing you to enjoy your favorite eJuices without frequent refills. Crafted from durable PCTG material, these pods are built to last. The user-friendly side fill system makes refilling a breeze. These pods come with integrated 0.8ohm or 1.0ohm coils for exceptional flavor delivery. Thanks to the magnetic connection, swapping out these pods is quick and hassle-free.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Side Fill System\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Integrated Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of four (4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.8 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775207972919,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 0.8 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.0 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775208005687,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 1.0 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-a3s-replacement-pod-min_e7e1acd5-cb3d-4e8a-917c-80889a5670ec.jpg?v=1752511754"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-swag-px80-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Swag PX80 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVaporesso Swag PX80 pod is compatible with Swag PX80 kit and packed with great features, c\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eartridge is compatible with GTX coils for ultra-smooth flavour. Vaporesso SWAG PX80 Pod can replace coil without emptying pod and adjust air inlets by rotating pod. What's more, SWAG PX80 Pod adopts quad leakage protection with a triple-silicon structure and e-juice self-circulating system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRefillable 4ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLeakproof Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBottom Filling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdjustable rotating airflow\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSupports Sub Ohm Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso GTX Coils\"\u003eCompatible With GTX Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775213510711,"sku":"V Swag PX80 Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-swag-pod-min.jpg?v=1752512247"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-pm40-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso LUXE PM40 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"richContent-root-CMO\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso LUXE PM40 replacement Pods (2-Pack), featuring a 4.0mL refillable capacity, top-fill system, and is compatible with the GTX Coil Series. \u003cem\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"richContent-root-CMO\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e4.0mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2x Replacement Pods\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775213543479,"sku":"V Luxe PM40 Replace Pods","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Vaporesso-Luxe-PM40-Replacement-Pod-min.jpg?v=1752512250"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-x-xr-replacement-pod","title":"Vaporesso LUXE X Replacement Pod","description":"\u003cdiv\u003eThe Vaporesso Luxe X replacement pods are compatible with the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe X Kit\"\u003eVaporesso Luxe X,\u003c\/a\u003e Luxe X Pro, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-xr-pod-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe XR Pod Kit\"\u003eLuxe XR\u003c\/a\u003e and Luxe XR Max vape kits. There are several different options to choose from, so no matter whether you prefer a discreet MTL (Mouth To Lung), balanced RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) or loose DTL (Direct To Lung) inhale, Vaporesso has you covered. The built-in coil pods offer more convenience as they require less maintenance, while the empty versions provide more flexibility as they can be paired with the full range of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso Gtx Coils\"\u003eVaporesso GTX coils.\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Mesh Or Replaceable GTX Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned For MTL, RDTL And DTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS Leak-Resistant Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom-Filling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nThe coils built into the Luxe pods feature a mesh build, so they’ll heat e-liquid quickly and evenly for improved flavour. The 0.4 Ohm Luxe X pod will deliver a DTL inhale and works best at 32W – pair it with 70% VG e-liquid for large amounts of vapour. Or, select the 0.8 Ohm Luxe X pod for an MTL vape as this pod works best at 16W and is ideal for 50% VG e-liquid.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"0.4 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215411255,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.4 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.6 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215444023,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.6 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215476791,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.8 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-luxe-x-replacement-pods-0.8ohm-min.jpg?v=1752512516"},{"product_id":"caliburn-explorer-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn Explorer Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn Explorer pods are designed for use with the Caliburn Explorer kit only. Featuring a unique split-pod design, these pods can hold two different e-liquids and coils at once, which can be vaped separately or together. Compatible with Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 coils, these pods will deliver your choice of MTL (Mouth To Lung) or RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) inhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable Pods For Caliburn Explorer\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity – 1ml Per Side\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide-Filling Design\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Uwell Kenya\"\u003eCompatible With Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuited To 50\/50 And High PG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach half of a Caliburn Explorer pod requires its own coil and e-liquid. This allows you to swap between two different flavours and coil resistances, or even vape both at once. To refill, simply open up the rubber stoppers on each side of the pod. The compatible coils from the Caliburn G and G2 series (sold separately) work best when paired with 50% VG or high PG e-liquid.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x Caliburn Explorer Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215542327,"sku":"Cali Explorer Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-explorer-replacement-pod-min.jpg?v=1752512527"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-xr-replacement-pod","title":"Vaporesso LUXE XR Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso LUXE XR Pods \u003cem\u003e(2-Pack)\u003c\/em\u003e, featuring a 5mL capacity, GTX Coil Compatibility, and filled from the bottom behind a silicone stopper.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-xr-pod-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxw XR Pod Kit\"\u003eVaporesso Luxe XR Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe X Kit\"\u003eVaporesso Luxe X Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso LUXE X Pods (Integrated Coil)\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso GTX Coils\"\u003eVaporesso GTX Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Vaporesso LUXE XR Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Bottom Fill - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: GTX Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe empty Luxe XR pods can be used with Vaporesso GTX coils. You can pair the DTL pod with either the 0.2 Ohm or 0.3 Ohm coil, while the RDTL pod can be used with the 0.4 Ohm or 0.6 Ohm GTX coils. For a more restricted inhale, select the MTL pod and insert a 0.8 Ohm or 1.2 Ohm coil. The DTL pod works best with e-liquid which is at least 70% VG, while the RDTL and MTL versions work best with 50% VG e-liquid.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne pack contains 2 replacement pods. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41861455675447,"sku":"V Luxe XR Replace Pods","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_xr_replacement_pods_packaging_contents_inside.png?v=1757065525"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xtank-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso XTank Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Vaporesso XTank Pods (2-Pack), featuring a 4.5mL Tank Capacity, Quarter Turn Side Fill System, and is compatible with the GTX Coil Series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso Gtx coils\"\u003eVaporesso GTX Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaporesso XTank Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4.5mL Tank Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Quarter Turn\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS 2.0 Leak Resistant Tech\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiquid Self Circulating System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with GTX Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41861496537143,"sku":"V xTank Replace Pods","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"th