 Airflow Control - RGC Pod Only\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"RPM Version","offer_id":42030442414135,"sku":"Smok RPM80 Replace Pods - RPM Version","price":1760.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"RGC Version","offer_id":42030442446903,"sku":"Smok RPM80 Replace Pods - RGC Version","price":1760.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_rpm80_replacement_pods_-_rpm_pod_box.webp?v=1766450416"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell CALIBURN Pods (4-Pack) are a set of food-grade replacement pods featuring a 2.0mL refillable pod, 1.2ohm and 1.4ohm Pod Coil Resistance, and possesses a top fill system, stoppered by the top cap drip tip mouthpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 1.2ohm and 1.4ohm Coils are fully cross-compatible with the Uwell Caliburn KOKO and the original Uwell Caliburn Pod System.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003eUwell CALIBURN\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-koko-pod-system\" title=\"Caliburn Koko system\"\u003eUwell CALIBURN KOKO\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42060670599223,"sku":"U Cali Replacement Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_replacement_pods_-_package_contents.jpg?v=1768410968"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-pods.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




